        "summary": "Bright green Tb3+ phosphor (CIE ~0.36, 0.56–0.58) with QY ~65%, average lifetime 1.34×10^6 ns. Hydrophobic (contact angle 126°); emission largely retained after 10 days in water. Thermal luminescence T50 = 236 °C (92.1% intensity at 150 °C, 70% at 200 °C). After 15 days of 365 nm UV, intensity remains 89.9%. Used as green phosphor in a WLED with CIE (0.34, 0.33) and 33 lm W−1.",
